\'91It is the truth that sets you free and not your effort \
to be free\'92 says Krishnamurti. \'91Seek Truth and Truth \
will make you free\'92 says Christ. \
\
All conscious and deliberate effort, all self-compul- \
sion by which we hope to reach some kind of perfec- \
tion is merely an attempt to shape ourselves according \
to a pattern and shows a complete misunderstanding \
of our real nature. We are so busy in becoming some- \
body else, that we have no chance to know what we \
are. No becoming can bring us to ourselves and so \
we live in perpetual illusion, born of ignorance of our \
